B.b3R=new A.cg("start-tour",null,B.at,"This guide explains the app one topic at a time. Next continues, Back revisits a step, and Contents lets you search or jump to any chapter. Close leaves the guide so you can try a control yourself. Reopen it from the question mark or Help & Support; reading the guide does not spend credits or submit answers.",B.aH,null,"Welcome to Norie Learning","",null,"")
