B.bqb=new A.an("Random motion mixes particles without changing their identities","comparison",B.axh,B.axB,"A conceptual gas-diffusion snapshot, not an exact timeline. Individual particles move in different directions; the net spreading reflects concentration differences. Motion continues after mixing.",B.u,"","g7-diffusion")
