B.axH=s(["A supplied calibrated field diameter is 4.0 mm.","With the same eyepiece setup, four times the magnification gives an approximately 1.0 mm field diameter.","Four equal cell widths spanning a 1.0 mm diameter suggest about 0.25 mm, or 250 \u03bcm, per cell."],t.s)
