B.aPX=s(["A supplied plant micrograph may show cell-wall outlines; a membrane may not be separately resolved.","A labeled prepared image can identify a nucleus; stain color alone is not a species test.","A mitochondrion drawn in a model may not be distinguishable in a classroom image; invisibility is not absence."],t.s)
